-## S4 CrisisEngine (GDD § M5, ADR-4, FORGE #3 — fair + predictable crises).
-##
-## Downstream of the flow: reads Topology + PacketFlow state, produces warnings +
-## CrisisEvents. NEVER owns/drives the demand timeline (that's the director's job,
-## upstream — a crisis is a CONSEQUENCE of topology + flow, never its own cause).
-## Every CrisisEvent carries a root_cause (§10.1.3) — fleshed in S4 (E4.1-E4.3).
-##
-## S0 scope: evaluate() returns a report carrying the director's forecast (so the
-## View can show the "weather report") but raises no warnings/crises yet.
-## Pure RefCounted (ADR-1); deterministic (trivially, while empty).
